    "legend": "<strong>A</strong>&nbsp;mRNA subtypes. Primary tumours (<em>n</em>&nbsp;=&nbsp;173) are displayed in columns, and clinical and genomic features are displayed in rows. Categorical features were analysed using the Fisher exact test; continuous features were analysed using the Kruskal&ndash;Wallis test. Select differentially expressed genes are displayed below each subtype. <strong>B</strong>&nbsp;DNA copy-number clustering {22544022}. Primary tumours (<em>n</em>&nbsp;=&nbsp;173) are displayed in columns. <strong>C</strong>&nbsp;DNA methylation clustering. Primary tumours (<em>n</em>&nbsp;=&nbsp;173) are displayed in columns. Features were tested for association with methylation subtypes by same methods as in&nbsp;<strong>A</strong>. <strong>D</strong>&nbsp;Ring plot displaying cross-platform subtype association. <em>p</em>&nbsp;refers to the chi-squared test on platform subtype versus mRNA expression subtype.",
